;; data/datascript-tx.edn — the EK source catalog. THIS IS THE ONLY PLACE THE
;; FACTS ARE AUTHORED. Both readings are generated from it:
;;
;;   src/association/facts.kotoba   the Clojure reading (`association.facts`)
;;   src/association_facts.kotoba   the Kotoba port
;;
;;   nbb scripts/gen-kotoba-port.cljk           rewrite both
;;   nbb scripts/gen-kotoba-port.cljk --check   exit 1 if either has drifted
;;   nbb scripts/verify-catalog.cljk            structural checks, offline
;;   nbb scripts/verify-catalog.cljk --live     fetch every :url and require
;;                                              every :source-quote to be in it
;;
;; Each entry names the page it came from (:source-article) and the verbatim
;; span the claim rests on (:source-quote). The span is what makes the citation
;; checkable: a URL that returns 200 without the claim reads exactly like one
;; that carries it. While this catalog was built, a finlex.fi PDF offered as
;; the official English translation of the Associations Act (503/1989) returned
;; 200 and turned out to be the Act on the Finnish Red Cross (238/2000) --
;; reachable, first-party, and the wrong document. It is not in this catalog
;; because the text was read.
;;
;; No personal names of office-holders are persisted here.

